se,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SXNa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"157835d6-2348-422c-92b5-59f295991343","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そういえば denops の文字列の中で `\u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;` や `\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;` のような特殊文字って入力できるんでしょうか？","ts":"1628766311.157100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6wo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93494e1e-518f-4e0f-9fae-4c9b6db8d823","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"お、それよさそう","ts":"1628766069.155100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uuLzg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e14f9a3-444e-4c75-9047-45271c12d3d1","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`gather` みたいな別の `batch` 関数作って、そっちはネストを認めないが戻り値を取得できるとかにしますか","ts":"1628766059.154900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TG/8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f73dac0f-cae1-4cc8-829f-085d98de7fc1","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;` もできるんですね。便利そう。","ts":"1628766057.154700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VYi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"234a135c-6b25-490c-8ee0-6c4da769f7af","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ネストできないの知らなかった","ts":"1628765947.153400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d=Y="}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0d770b3-87ca-429e-bf20-58af5c45123e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"別に認めないとかでもよさそう(ただ明記しておいた方がいいと思いますね)","ts":"1628765942.153200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mKufu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83eaffda-713c-4924-b082-10cde8369fb9","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"どっちか","ts":"1628765701.152200","team"