_text","block_id":"h+s9r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cb6863c-7253-40f2-b93d-a435eba2f458","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1628765457.148400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RVSUX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69ef1236-cc7b-4660-ae8c-fe81840dfca0","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"batch は特殊処理なので...","ts":"1628765450.148200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PckPf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92d0ec22-6448-4010-80d6-d0e151538309","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"いえ、使う側に意識させたいのです","ts":"1628765440.147900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IODs="}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc4215c9-fe8e-4b29-b8d1-63f15ee681a5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"mappingモジュールの中で、modeが1つ以上あったらbatchを使って処理させるってのはどうでしょうか\n使う側がbatchを使う・使わないを意識しなくて済むので楽かなと","ts":"1628765424.147700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hTD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43f6ad14-2b46-46c1-944f-5765db4b5e67","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"すげ","ts":"1628765354.146800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zZNW2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87779ba9-5aa3-49a4-b3b5-22fc976ae2bb","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"まじか denops はえぇ","ts":"1628765317.146500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Cr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70022d99-2594-4e74-b0a7-3887af94d740","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"試しに外してみたけどこの程度じゃ全然分からないな、もっとパフォーマンスに影響出るような量じゃないと","ts":"1628765303.146300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ob"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5E7E708D-2A85-47FC-BDC0-5C619CFD403F","t